#: scrnsave.cpp:181
msgid "&Enable screensaver"
msgstr "&Cho phe'p du`ng screen saver"

#: scrnsave.cpp:186
msgid ""
"Check this box if you would like to enable a screen saver. If you have power "
"saving features enabled for your display, you may still enable a screen "
"saver."
msgstr ""
"Cho.n ho^.p na`y ne^'u ba.n muo^'n du`ng screen saver . Ne^'u ba.n ddang du`ng"
"chu+'c na(ng tie^'t kie^.m na(ng lu+o+.ng cho ma`n hi`nh, ba.n va^~n co' the^? du`ng"
"screen saver ."

#: scrnsave.cpp:195
